title: The Frankfurt Congress
subtitle: The Ninth Party Congress decides who leads the KPD after the defeat.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1924 and month >= 4 and rf_over = 0
max-visits: 1

= The Ninth Party Congress, Frankfurt

The congress meets in Frankfurt in April 1924. The party has lost members, money and its illusions. Most delegates are angry, and the anger runs to the left. Zinoviev's representatives are in the hall.

What should the congress be about?

- @revolution
- @unity
- @moscow
- @independence

@revolution
title: The lessons of October: a revolutionary party, purged of opportunists.
subtitle: Strongly pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span>. Angers the <span class="f-right">Right</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 6, ultra: 2, right: -6});
!}
go-to: result

@unity
title: Unity: no purges, a shared leadership.
subtitle: Strongly pleases the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. Calms every faction.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {center: 6});
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 6; }
!}
go-to: result

@moscow
title: Bolshevization: the party will follow the ECCI's line in everything.
subtitle: Strongly pleases Moscow and <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>. Angers the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.obey(Q, 12);
!}
go-to: result

@independence
title: A German party for German workers: Moscow advises, it does not command.
subtitle: Strongly pleases the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Enrages <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>. Moscow may intervene.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.defy(Q, 14);
window.RF.lean(Q, {ultra: 3});
!}
go-to: result

@result
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.normalize(Q);
window.RF.congress(Q);
Q.rf_over = 1;
Q.rf_ending = 'frankfurt';
!}

= The vote

[? if congress_compromise : No faction commands a majority. The congress elects the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span> as a compromise leadership. ?][? if congress_compromise = 0 : The delegates give the <span class="f-[+ congress_winner +]">[+ congress_winner_name +]</span> the majority. ?]

[? if moscow_overruled : The <span class="p-comintern">Comintern</span>'s representatives refuse to accept the result. Moscow's choice, the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>, forms the new Zentrale. ?]
